  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote Education for Girls in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direction Digital is a project focused in digital inclusion  primarily for girls in Brazil. It enables continuing development of new school teachers in educational digital technologies, community orientation and resources to families in remote areas to have access to education digitally, specially after COVID-19. Funds will provide resources deployed to families with girls from 04 to 14 years old, food and school supplies for the most vulnerable students and develop monitors as village leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
